  "description": "Context-aware PII detection and de-identification for AgentGuard. Provides validated regex recognizers (credit card, IBAN, crypto, US SSN/ITIN, email, IP, URL, MAC, phone) with confidence scoring and overlap resolution, plus anonymization operators (replace, redact, mask, hash, encrypt/decrypt, keep, custom). Inspired by the architecture of Microsoft Presidio (MIT). Framework-agnostic, fully offline. See https://github.com/filipw/AgentGuard for details.",
